WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.480
Welcome to our training start selling subscription boxes.

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:08.220
Customers use the Amazon store every day to purchase products they're familiar with.

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:14.420
But many also use the selection available through Amazon to discover new products, brands and services.

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:20.467
If you're a seller looking to reach more customers, you can help them explore in the Amazon store

00:00:20.467 --> 00:00:21.700
by selling subscription boxes.

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:28.255
A subscription box is a curated collection of products in a single category that's sent to a customer

00:00:28.255 --> 00:00:29.640
on a recurring basis.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.400
Each box contains a different set of products assembled by the seller.

00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:39.662
Customers subscribe to a subscription box service and pay a regular amount per cycle so they can

00:00:39.662 --> 00:00:40.980
keep discovering new items.

00:00:41.740 --> 00:00:47.155
Subscription boxes come in a variety of categories, including beauty, food and drink, pets, toys

00:00:47.155 --> 00:00:48.960
and kids and t-shirts.

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:54.425
They can be created with variations, meaning different versions of the same subscription box can

00:00:54.425 --> 00:00:56.100
be sent to different customers.

00:00:57.060 --> 00:01:00.240
Sellers who sell subscription boxes can include their own

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:03.420
branded products or items they're reselling from other brands.

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:10.083
They can also include products that are already listed in the Amazon store or new products that

00:01:10.083 --> 00:01:13.320
customers can only receive by subscribing to their subscription box.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:17.740
You can apply anytime to sell subscription boxes in the Amazon store.

00:01:18.460 --> 00:01:19.237
Visit sell.

00:01:19.237 --> 00:01:19.625
amazon.

00:01:19.625 --> 00:01:23.120
com and hover over the start drop-down menu.

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:25.660
Then click Amazon Selling Programs.

00:01:26.360 --> 00:01:32.640
On the Programs page, scroll down, find the Sell Subscription Boxes tile, and click Learn More.

00:01:33.160 --> 00:01:36.940
Then click the apply now button on the next page to access the application.

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:41.900
We'll respond to your application via email within 7 to 10 business days.

00:01:41.900 --> 00:01:47.378
If you're approved, you'll then need to set up your seller central account for subscription box

00:01:47.378 --> 00:01:51.080
sales and fill out a subscription box listing template.

00:01:51.940 --> 00:01:54.720
Let's review seller central account setup first.

00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:59.060
Start by creating a professional selling account if you don't have one already.

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:00.910
Visit sell.

00:02:00.910 --> 00:02:01.445
amazon.

00:02:01.445 --> 00:02:01.980
com.

00:02:02.360 --> 00:02:04.560
Click the sign up button and follow the prompts.

00:02:05.280 --> 00:02:10.460
Next, complete all state-specific tax settings in Seller Central if you haven't done so already.

00:02:11.420 --> 00:02:15.860
Sign in to Seller Central, click the gear icon and then click tax settings.

00:02:16.520 --> 00:02:18.640
Follow the prompts to complete the process.

00:02:19.160 --> 00:02:23.440
Finally, create a subscription box specific shipping template in Seller Central.

00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:29.360
Click the gear icon, then shipping settings, and then the create new shipping template button.

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:32.740
On the next page, enter a shipping template name.

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:37.940
Then, under domestic shipping, select standard shipping as your sole shipping method.

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:44.137
Make sure you don't accidentally select shipping region automation, which doesn't apply to subscription

00:02:44.137 --> 00:02:44.540
boxes.

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:52.240
Then, select the 48 contiguous US states, Hawaii, Alaska, and Puerto Rico, and Guam as your regions.

00:02:52.420 --> 00:02:56.460
These are the only regions where Amazon subscription boxes can be shipped.

00:02:57.160 --> 00:03:00.500
Make sure you're able to send boxes to each location directly.

00:03:01.560 --> 00:03:06.220
After selecting regions, enter a shipping fee of $0 for each one.

00:03:06.840 --> 00:03:11.060
When you've completed all entries for your shipping template, click the save button.

00:03:11.740 --> 00:03:17.706
On the next page, take a screenshot of your full template and copy and save the string of alphanumeric

00:03:17.706 --> 00:03:18.020
characters

00:03:18.020 --> 00:03:21.160
between the number sign and slash success in the URL.

00:03:21.640 --> 00:03:25.280
You'll need this screenshot and alphanumeric string later.

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:30.402
Once you have a professional selling account with the right tax settings and shipping template,

00:03:30.402 --> 00:03:34.500
you're ready to fill out a listing template for your subscription boxes.

00:03:35.280 --> 00:03:41.489
You can download the template using the link included in the email you received from the subscription

00:03:41.489 --> 00:03:42.220
box team.

00:03:42.220 --> 00:03:47.965
When you open the template, start by reviewing the instructions, examples, data definitions,

00:03:47.965 --> 00:03:51.500
and valid values sheets for information and guidance.

00:03:51.940 --> 00:03:55.520
Then, add your subscription box information to the template sheet.

00:03:56.040 --> 00:04:00.280
Let's review entries on the template sheet specific to subscription boxes.

00:04:00.700 --> 00:04:04.335
If you'd like more information about additional required entries,

00:04:04.335 --> 00:04:07.969
you can review our other modules in Seller University

00:04:07.969 --> 00:04:11.200
about creating listings and product variations in bulk.

00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:15.500
The first entry you'll add to the template sheet will be for product type.

00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:19.160
For each row, make sure subscription box is selected.

00:04:19.720 --> 00:04:24.100
Next, in the byline column, enter the brand name of your subscription box service.

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:28.097
If you need to add variation information to the template,

00:04:28.097 --> 00:04:34.140
keep in mind that only three variations or fewer can be included in a subscription box file upload.

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:38.563
If you want your subscription box to come in more than three variations,

00:04:38.563 --> 00:04:40.740
you can make entries in additional rows.

00:04:40.740 --> 00:04:46.403
But keep in mind that you'll need to send your completed listing template back to the subscription

00:04:46.403 --> 00:04:47.069
box team

00:04:47.069 --> 00:04:51.400
for manual processing rather than trying to upload it yourself in Seller Central.

00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:57.640
When you add offer information to the listing template, start by choosing whether you want to send

00:04:57.640 --> 00:04:58.600
your subscription boxes

00:04:58.600 --> 00:05:01.160
to customers every one, two, or three months.

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:06.150
You can also choose to offer an introductory price if you want customers to receive their first

00:05:06.150 --> 00:05:07.220
box at a discount.

00:05:07.780 --> 00:05:12.165
Next, when entering fulfillment information, select anniversary shipping as your shipping type,

00:05:12.165 --> 00:05:19.473
if for each cycle you want to send a box to each customer within seven business days of the specific

00:05:19.473 --> 00:05:21.300
date they started their subscription.

00:05:22.100 --> 00:05:27.500
Or select calendar-based shipping to indicate that you'll send subscription boxes to all customers

00:05:27.500 --> 00:05:28.940
within seven business days

00:05:28.940 --> 00:05:31.460
of the same date in each cycle.

00:05:31.920 --> 00:05:37.808
Remember that if you select anniversary shipping, you'll receive and fulfill orders on a rolling

00:05:37.808 --> 00:05:38.200
basis.

00:05:38.200 --> 00:05:44.607
But if you select calendar-based shipping, you'll receive and fulfill all orders simultaneously

00:05:44.607 --> 00:05:45.980
once per cycle.

00:05:46.420 --> 00:05:51.932
After selecting your shipping type, enter the string of alphanumeric characters you saved from your

00:05:51.932 --> 00:05:53.035
shipping template URL

00:05:53.035 --> 00:05:55.240
in the shipping template ID column.

00:05:55.700 --> 00:06:01.087
Then, if you selected calendar-based shipping, provide a cutoff day of the month that will be used

00:06:01.087 --> 00:06:02.671
for each subscription box cycle

00:06:02.671 --> 00:06:05.840
as well as the first cutoff date for your service.

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:11.660
You'll also need to enter a fulfillment day of the month and first fulfillment date if you selected

00:06:11.660 --> 00:06:12.560
calendar-based shipping.

00:06:13.200 --> 00:06:16.500
Base both on your entries from the two previous columns.

00:06:16.980 --> 00:06:20.748
Finally, to complete your listing template, open the shipping template sheet

00:06:20.748 --> 00:06:25.200
and insert the screenshot you took of your shipping template in Seller Central.

00:06:26.300 --> 00:06:32.094
After completing your template, you can upload it to the same page in Seller Central where you downloaded

00:06:32.094 --> 00:06:33.060
a blank copy.

00:06:33.480 --> 00:06:37.341
Or, to share a listing template that includes more than three variations,

00:06:37.341 --> 00:06:40.880
reply to the email you received from the subscription box team.

00:06:41.120 --> 00:06:45.434
You can also reply to the subscription box team if you have questions

00:06:45.434 --> 00:06:48.420
or want to explore options like Customize and Subscribe,

00:06:48.980 --> 00:06:53.560
which allows customers to request certain types of products in their subscription boxes.

00:06:54.360 --> 00:06:59.329
We'll notify you when we've listed your subscription box and launched your service in the Amazon

00:06:59.329 --> 00:06:59.640
Store.

00:07:00.280 --> 00:07:01.460
This concludes our training.

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:04.840
Thank you and happy selling in the Amazon Store!
